# OpenAI model for this project's local + agent inference (read by openai-proxy/proxy.mjs).
# The API key stays in ~/.dbeaver-ai-complete; only the model choice lives here.
# Precedence: OPENAI_MODEL env var > this file > ~/.dbeaver-ai-complete > default (gpt-4.1).
#
# gpt-5.3-codex is OpenAI's SOTA coding model. It is served ONLY via the Responses
# API, so the proxy auto-routes codex models there (translating Anthropic Messages
# <-> Responses, tools + streaming). Override the surface with OPENAI_API=chat|responses.
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.3-codex
